  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal of MYNSAM 2.0 framework with Ministry of Food, Agriculture and Fisheries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to appraise and make recommendations for finalizing and for presentation to Council for Development Policy of the pilot 4-year framework programmes of Sector Support Cooperation (SSC), which will be basis for framework agreements between Ministry of Foreign Affairs and host ministries, agencies and city administrations respectively.

The scope of work will address but not be limited to the below:

The appraisal will overall focus on the framework programme level (as opposed to project-level) and be guided by the overall appraisal criteria as described in the Danida AMG. 

In addition, the appraisal will overall assess the adequacy with which the main new elements that follow from the recent revised SSC guidelines (MYNSAM 2.0) are reflected in the pilot-programme</narrative>
  </description>
